urrent lead in the cumulative score. Checking allows you to see the flop without investing more chips.\n\nReason: With a speculative hand like 8-7 offsuit and the option to see a free flop, checking is the most strategic move to control pot size and maintain your chip lead.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
